WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.752
Hi, I'm Kiki. I help school support staff find certifications and training.

00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:12.360
We match training to your role: para certificates, safety training and short courses that build your skills.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.360
For example, ask me: what certifications can support staff get?
